      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved this memory.\n\nSummary saved: You took a weekend trip to the countryside with your best friend Sarah; you explored charming towns, hiked in lush forests, and had a relaxing time away from the city.\n\nWould you like me to do any of the following with it?\n- Draft/send a message to Sarah (thank-you or recap).\n- Create a short social post caption.\n- Save it as a dated journal entry or note (with the trip dates, if you provide them).\n- Add related photos or tag this memory for easy lookup later.\n- Nothing else — just keep it in my notes.\n\nWhich would you like?",
