    {
      "step": 6,
      "user_message": "I attended a painting workshop last weekend with my cousin, Rachel. The class was held at the local art gallery downtown, and we both tried our hand at creating abstract art using acrylics. Rachel ended up painting a vibrant seascape, while I opted for a more minimalistic geometric design.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I attended a painting workshop last weekend with my cousin, Rachel. The class was held at the local art gallery downtown, and we both tried our hand at creating abstract art using acrylics. Rachel ended up painting a vibrant seascape, while I opted for a more minimalistic geometric design.",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved this memory.\n\nSummary saved: You attended a painting workshop last weekend with your cousin Rachel at the local art gallery downtown. You both worked in acrylics on abstract pieces — Rachel painted a vibrant seascape and you created a minimalistic geometric design.\n\nWould you like me to do any of the following?\n- Draft/send a quick message to Rachel (examples below).\n  - Casual: “Hey Rachel — I had so much fun at the painting workshop last weekend. Your seascape was amazing — want to grab coffee and compare notes / photos soon?”\n  - Short: “Loved painting with you — your seascape was gorgeous! Want to do it again?”\n- Create a social post caption:\n  - “Tried abstract acrylics with my cousin Rachel at the local art gallery — she painted a vibrant seascape, I did a minimal geometric piece. Great weekend! 🎨”\n- Save as a dated journal entry or note (tell me the date if you want it attached).\n- Tag/organize this memory (e.g., tags: painting, acrylics, Rachel, art gallery).\n- Add/organize photos (if you provide them).\n- Do nothing else — just keep it in my notes.\n\nWhich would you like me to do?",
