    {
      "step": 7,
      "user_message": "I took a weekend trip to the mountains with my childhood friend, Emily. We explored scenic trails, had a picnic by the lake, and even went stargazing at night. It was a perfect getaway to unwind and reconnect with nature.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I took a weekend trip to the mountains with my childhood friend, Emily. We explored scenic trails, had a picnic by the lake, and even went stargazing at night. It was a perfect getaway to unwind and reconnect with nature.",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved this memory.\n\nSummary saved: You took a weekend trip to the mountains with your childhood friend Emily; you explored scenic trails, had a picnic by the lake, and went stargazing at night. It was a relaxing, nature-filled getaway.\n\nWould you like me to do any of the following now?\n- Draft/send a message to Emily (examples: “Hey Emily — loved our mountain trip. The picnic and stargazing were perfect — let’s plan another getaway soon!”).\n- Create a social post caption (example: “Weekend in the mountains with Emily — trails, a lakeside picnic, and stargazing. Perfect recharge. 🌲✨”).\n- Save it as a dated journal entry or note (tell me the dates if you want them attached).\n- Tag/organize this memory (e.g., tags: mountains, Emily, hiking, stargazing).\n- Add/organize photos (if you provide them).\n- Nothing else — just keep it in my notes.\n\nWhich would you like?",
