    {
      "step": 8,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I participated in a wine tasting event at the local vineyard last Saturday with my colleagues from work. We sampled a variety of red and white wines, and I discovered a new favorite Merlot that I absolutely loved. It was a fun and relaxing way to spend the afternoon bonding with my coworkers outside of the office.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I participated in a wine tasting event at the local vineyard last Saturday with my colleagues from work. We sampled a variety of red and white wines, and I discovered a new favorite Merlot that I absolutely loved. It was a fun and relaxing way to spend the afternoon bonding with my coworkers outside of the office.",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve saved this memory.\n\nSummary saved: You attended a wine-tasting event at the local vineyard last Saturday with colleagues. You sampled several red and white wines and discovered a new favorite Merlot. It was a fun, relaxing afternoon for bonding outside the office.\n\nWould you like me to do any of the following?\n- Draft/send a thank-you or follow-up email to your colleagues (examples below).\n- Draft/post a short review for the vineyard.\n- Create a social post caption.\n- Save it as a dated journal entry or note (tell me the date if you want it attached).\n- Tag/organize this memory (e.g., tags: wine tasting, vineyard, Merlot, colleagues).\n- Add/organize photos (if you provide them).\n- Nothing else — just keep it in my notes.\n\nExample messages you can pick or edit:\n- To colleagues (casual): “Thanks for a lovely afternoon at the vineyard last Saturday — great company and that Merlot was a highlight! Let’s do something like this again soon.”\n- Vineyard review: “Enjoyed a delightful wine-tasting at the local vineyard. Great selection of reds and whites — the Merlot was a standout. Highly recommend for a relaxing afternoon out.”\n- Social caption: “Wine tasting at the local vineyard with colleagues — discovered a new favorite Merlot. Perfect afternoon. 🍷”\n\nWhich would you like me to do?",
