      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I visited my grandparents over the weekend. It was great catching up with them and enjoying a home-cooked meal together. My grandma even taught me a new recipe for her famous apple pie that I can't wait to try at home.",
      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved this memory.\n\nSummary saved: You visited your grandparents over the weekend, enjoyed catching up and a home-cooked meal, and your grandma taught you her famous apple pie recipe that you’re excited to try.\n\nWould you like me to do any of the following now?\n- Draft/send a quick thank-you message to your grandparents (example: “Thanks for a lovely weekend — the meal was wonderful and I can’t wait to try Grandma’s apple pie recipe!”).  \n- Save Grandma’s apple pie recipe as a note or recipe entry (you can paste the recipe or I can format what you remember).  \n- Create a dated journal entry or note (tell me the date if you want it attached).  \n- Create a social post caption (example: “Visited my grandparents this weekend — delicious home-cooked meal and learned Grandma’s apple pie recipe!”).  \n- Tag/organize this memory for easy lookup later (e.g., tags: grandparents, family, recipe).  \n- Nothing else — just keep it in my notes.\n\nWhich would you like?",
