      "agent_response": "I couldn't find any email in your inbox that names the colleague you dined with at The Rustic Kitchen on Oak Street last night.\n\nDo you want me to send the recommendation to henry.garcia@example.com now? If so, please confirm or tell me:\n- The colleague's name (if you want it mentioned), and\n- How you'd like to sign the email (your name or leave unsigned).\n\nProposed message I'll send unless you ask to change it:\nSubject: Recommendation — The Rustic Kitchen on Oak Street\nBody:\nHi Henry — I wanted to recommend The Rustic Kitchen on Oak Street. I dined there last night and had a delightful experience — great food and atmosphere. I think you'd really enjoy it. — [Your Name]\n\nReply with the colleague name (optional), the name to sign with, or just \"Send\" to go ahead as-is (I'll leave the signature blank if you don't provide a name).",
