      "agent_response": "I couldn't find any email in your inbox that records what you and Sarah did on your weekend countryside trip.\n\nPlease tell me one of the following so I can send the email to alice.johnson@yahoo.com:\n\n1) Give the activities you want me to include (e.g., \"hiked to a waterfall, had a picnic, stargazed\"), and the name to sign with — then I'll send it now.  \n2) Pick from these sample activity lists and confirm which one to use, plus the signature:\n   - A: Hiked to a waterfall, had a picnic, and stargazed.  \n   - B: Visited a vineyard for a tasting, toured the town market, and rode bikes.  \n   - C: Went horseback riding, cooked a big dinner together, and took lots of photos.  \n   - D: Tell me your own custom list.\n\nProposed email (I'll send this once you confirm or edit):\n- To: alice.johnson@yahoo.com\n- Subject: Weekend trip to the countryside — what Sarah and I did\n- Body:\n  Hi Alice — Just wanted to share what Sarah and I did during our weekend trip to the countryside: [ACTIVITIES]. It was a lovely time and thought you'd enjoy hearing about it. — [Your Name]\n\nReply with the activities to include and the name to sign with, or say \"Send as A (or B/C) — [Your Name]\" and I'll send it.",
