.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Your Benefits Enrollment Deadline\nDate: 2025-10-06T14:45:00Z\nStatus: Read\nBody:\nThis is a reminder to complete your benefits enrollment by October 20. Please log in to the HR portal to review and confirm your coverage options for the upcoming plan year.\nIf you do not make your selections by the deadline, your current benefits may automatically renew or default coverage may apply.\n\nFor any questions or assistance, please contact the HR Benefits Team at help@enron.com.\n",
